# Benchmark artefacts are committed on purpose: every published number is
# derived from them and `pnpm docs:check` diffs the docs against them.
!packages/bench/out/
!packages/bench/out/**
# The eval report is committed for the same reason: it is generated only,
# never hand-typed (Module 24 §9).
!evals/out/
!evals/out/**
